feat(sarif): export machine-readable decision justification

A consumer could read status, confidence_score, confidence_band, source_tier and
reachable and still not answer "why exactly did this BLOCK my build?". Results
now carry properties.decision: the verdict, its plain-text reason, the
independent and self-evident signal lists, and the evidence flags behind them.

  "decision": {
    "status": "BLOCK",
    "reason": "severity at or above the --fail-on threshold; corroborated by: reachable taint path",
    "independent_signals": ["reachable taint path"],
    "evidence": {"reachable": true, "flow_established": true,
                 "source_controlled": true, "sink_detected": true}
  }

THE EVIDENCE SUB-OBJECT IS A MAP, NOT A STRUCT. A struct field is either true or
false and this contract needs a third state: an ABSENT key means "not
evaluated", never "evaluated and false". `omitempty` on a bool would be the same
error wearing a different hat — it collapses false into absent, making a
genuinely evaluated false unrepresentable. Rendering unknown as false is the
defect class this whole change exists to remove, so the exporter must not
reintroduce it at the boundary.

decision.Decision now carries the partitioned Corroboration, computed ONCE in
decide(). The gate, the reason string and the export all read the same
partition; re-deriving it downstream is how an exporter drifts from the policy
it claims to describe.

models.Finding gains decision_reason, independent_signals, self_evident_signals
and auth_expectation — all omitempty, all STAMPED by engine.stampDecisions from
the post-Restore evidence rather than projected through evidence.ToFinding, for
the same reason the cross-tool corroboration pair is: projecting would publish a
pre-dedup value and undo the proof-union fold on a public surface. They are
registered in evidence_test.notRoundTripped, whose companion test asserts each
exemption is genuine rather than a parking space.

auth_expectation is published because the DECISION cites it: an auditable
verdict cannot reference a field the report withholds.

Additive only. The import golden report diff is three added keys and no changed
ones; a report produced without the decision pass emits no decision block at
all (TestNoDecisionBlockWhenNoDecisionPassRan).

Full suite: 39 packages ok, 0 failures.

